{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-optimization","title":"性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/regex-engines/performance-optimization","wordCount":1128,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能优化\">性能优化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>正则性能取决于模式结构、输入规模与引擎实现，优化的核心目标只有一个：<strong>减少回溯次数、让引擎尽早确定匹配或失败</strong>。围绕这一目标，锚点、字符类、交替分支与预编译等手段各司其职。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>锚点 <code>^ $ \\b</code> 限定匹配位置，避免在输入的每个位置盲目尝试起始匹配。</li>\n<li>精确字符类 <code>[^X]*</code> 替代通配 <code>.*</code>，消除不必要的回溯路径。</li>\n<li>交替分支按匹配概率排序、提取公共前缀、单字符交替改写为字符类；正则对象预编译并缓存，避免循环内重复创建。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"正则性能的基本原则\">正则性能的基本原则</h2><p>正则表达式的性能取决于三个因素：模式的结构、输入字符串的长度和内容、以及引擎的实现。优化的核心目标是<strong>减少回溯次数</strong>和<strong>让引擎尽早确定匹配或失败</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const naive = /.*foo/;&#10;const optimized = /foo/;&#10;&#10;const text = &#39;a&#39;.repeat(10000) + &#39;foo&#39;;&#10;const start1 = performance.now();&#10;naive.test(text);&#10;const t1 = performance.now() - start1;&#10;&#10;const start2 = performance.now();&#10;optimized.test(text);&#10;const t2 = performance.now() - start2;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> naive</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">foo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> optimized</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">foo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'a'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'foo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> start1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">naive.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(text);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> start2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">optimized.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(text);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start2;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化层面</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模式结构</td>\n<td>使用精确字符类</td>\n<td>减少候选路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锚点</td>\n<td>添加 <code>^</code> <code>$</code> <code>\\b</code> 限定位置</td>\n<td>减少起始位置尝试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量词</td>\n<td>避免嵌套量词</td>\n<td>消除指数回溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预编译</td>\n<td>缓存正则对象</td>\n<td>避免重复编译</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引擎选择</td>\n<td>简单模式用 DFA 引擎</td>\n<td>保证线性时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"锚点优化\">锚点优化</h2><p>添加锚点是最简单也最有效的优化手段。没有锚点的模式需要在输入字符串的每个位置尝试匹配。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const withoutAnchor = /\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}/;&#10;const withAnchor = /^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/;&#10;&#10;const input = &#39;a&#39;.repeat(10000);&#10;withoutAnchor.test(input);&#10;withAnchor.test(input);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> withoutAnchor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{4}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> withAnchor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{4}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'a'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">withoutAnchor.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">withAnchor.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;无锚点&quot;&#10;        NA1[&quot;位置 0: 尝试匹配&quot;] --&gt; NA2[&quot;位置 1: 尝试匹配&quot;]&#10;        NA2 --&gt; NA3[&quot;位置 2: 尝试匹配&quot;]&#10;        NA3 --&gt; NA4[&quot;... 逐位置尝试&quot;]&#10;        NA4 --&gt; NA5[&quot;位置 n: 尝试匹配&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;有锚点 ^...$&quot;&#10;        A1[&quot;位置 0: 尝试匹配&quot;] --&gt; A2[&quot;成功或失败,立即返回&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"无锚点\"\n        NA1[\"位置 0: 尝试匹配\"] --&gt; NA2[\"位置 1: 尝试匹配\"]\n        NA2 --&gt; NA3[\"位置 2: 尝试匹配\"]\n        NA3 --&gt; NA4[\"... 逐位置尝试\"]\n        NA4 --&gt; NA5[\"位置 n: 尝试匹配\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"有锚点 ^...$\"\n        A1[\"位置 0: 尝试匹配\"] --&gt; A2[\"成功或失败,立即返回\"]\n    end</pre><p>锚点优化策略：</p>\n<h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>未优化</th>\n<th>优化后</th>\n<th>提升原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入验证</td>\n<td><code>/\\d{6}/</code></td>\n<td><code>/^\\d{6}$/</code></td>\n<td>只尝试一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行首匹配</td>\n<td><code>/ERROR.*/</code></td>\n<td><code>/^ERROR.*/m</code></td>\n<td>跳过非行首位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全词匹配</td>\n<td><code>/error/</code></td>\n<td><code>/\\berror\\b/</code></td>\n<td>跳过词中位置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>提示：</strong> 现代引擎（如 V8）会自动检测某些可以优化的模式。例如，以字面量字符开头的模式会使用 Boyer-Moore 等快速字符串搜索算法定位起始位置。但显式锚点仍然是最可靠的优化方式。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"字符类优化\">字符类优化</h2><p>使用精确的字符类替代通配符，可以显著减少回溯路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const bad = /&quot;.*&quot;/;&#10;const good = /&quot;[^&quot;]*&quot;/;&#10;&#10;const text = &#39;&quot;a&quot;&#39; + &#39; &quot;b&quot;&#39;.repeat(1000);&#10;const start1 = performance.now();&#10;bad.exec(text);&#10;performance.now() - start1;&#10;&#10;const start2 = performance.now();&#10;good.exec(text);&#10;performance.now() - start2;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bad</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"c